# Review regression (D7, D2). Before: on battery an unlocked meeting dims after a minute;
# when the battery stopped it, the screen went from dimmed straight to black and locked, so
# "会议已停：电量低" was never shown until some later G0 tap.
# Now: the end lights the screen as a key would (the result page and its toast), then it
# dims, goes dark and locks as usual.
boot store=sd usb=off bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
mic 70000 2500
shot dimmed  a meeting left alone 70 s on battery: dimmed
bat 3440
mic 12000 2500
wait 300
shot stopped  the battery stopped it: lit, 会议已停：电量低
wait 45000
shot still  45 s on: still lit
wait 20000
shot dark  then dark and locked (D2)
